Third-Party Font & Engine Notices:
1. Open-Source Fonts (`IBMPlexSansArabic`, `ReadexPro`, `ZainRounded`, `Alkhalil-Kufi`):
   Licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 (https://openfontlicense.org).
2. Display & Editorial Fonts (`Thmanyah Serif Display`, `Thmanyah Sans`, `Thmanyah Serif Text`,
   `KOMission`, `Qahwa Arabic`, `Setabr Display`, `ZIAN`):
   Included for local desktop/browser presentation rendering; all rights and trademarks belong
   to their respective type foundries and rights holders.
3. Bundled Engines (`resources/engine/anatomy` and `resources/engine/frontend-slides`):
   Included as self-contained skill modules for isometric SVG synthesis and 1920x1080 slide staging.
